 "title": "一键打印打印不了在DHERP上传的质检报告图片",
 "problem": "一键打印打印不了在DHERP上传的质检报告图片",
 "cause": "通过ip访问V12上传的图片，每次都提示要登录系统",
 "solution": "Tomcat\\webappS\\ROOT\\WEB-INF\\WEB.XML文件里的param-value 改成N\n<servlet>\n<servlet-name>img</servlet-name>\n<servlet-class>com.artery.form.lmageServlet</servlet-class>\n<init-param>\n<param-name>authentication</param-name>\n<param-value>Y</param-value></init-param>\n<load-on-startup>3</load-on-startup></servlet>",
